  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/328) by Laurent BERNE (Bitbucket: [Laurent BERNE](https://bitbucket.org/Laurent BERNE), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHello,\n\n I can’t install ART on my  Surface pro 11 because the installer don’t accept the Qualcom  Snapdragon as a valid CPU \\(I know it’s an ARM CPU\\).\n\nThe original RawTherapee works fine with the Prism emulation layer, so logically ART too. \n\nThe only lock to use ART is the installer who refuse to proceed.\n\n‌\n\nThanks !\n",
